	'k1d42aef9' => 'INCLUDED',
	'k1d82579d' => 'We work exclusively with small and mid-size commercial firms operating from physical yards, workshops, and facilities. We understand the specific operational vulnerabilities that generic insurance schedules fail to address.',
	'k1e224391' => '© Hojo Brokers, 3rd floor, 18 Quayside Road, Calder Bay. A fictional firm; all names and figures are invented.',
	'k1e69ab97' => 'Employers\' liability protects your firm against statutory legal costs and damages when an employee, apprentice, or temporary worker sustains injury or illness during the course of their work.',
	'k22242686' => 'To make our 90-minute site visit as productive as possible, we ask you to provide your current insurance schedule, renewal statement, and full policy wording booklet. Having copies of your most recent electrical inspection certificates, fire risk assessments, and lease agreements is also beneficial. You do not need to prepare elaborate presentations or tidy operational areas; we need to inspect your yard, storage bays, and plant rooms exactly as they operate during an ordinary working week.',
	'k2299658c' => 'Dedicated Claims Advocacy',
	'k239c2be8' => 'Hojo Brokers operates as an independent commercial insurance broker founded in 2009, located on the 3rd floor at 18 Quayside Road, Calder Bay. Our initial cover review for a single site is provided at €0 with no obligation to place insurance through our firm. When a client instructs us to place or renew cover, our full brokerage commission is disclosed in writing on every quote sheet presented from 3–5 competing insurers. Additional professional services, including multi-site reviews at €480 and contract wording reads at €160, are billed strictly according to our published fee schedule.',
	'k242b21bf' => 'The first call is answered the same day in office hours. Tell us what happened, where, and whether anyone is hurt or the site is unsafe.',
	'k24814f5b' => 'We present our findings in a focused 60-minute meeting. If adjustments or market remarketing are required, we present competitive options sourced from 3–5 reputable insurers. During this meeting, every policy exclusion and condition precedent is read aloud in plain words so there are no surprises during a loss. We disclose our full commission on every quote presented. There is absolutely no obligation to place cover through us; you retain full control and keep the written cover map regardless of your decision.',
	'k24c3a672' => 'Wholesale operations and trade counters combine busy trade customer collection areas with active pallet racking and heavy vehicle traffic.',
	'k251c52ea' => 'ONE ADVOCATE',
	'k294d93d9' => 'Before you commit to anything we read every exclusion and warranty aloud across the table in plain language. If a wording demands nightly sprinkler tests or a maximum stacking height, we confirm it can be met on an ordinary working day before paper is signed.',
