	'k31e9f0ee' => 'Cyber and data cover reimburses business restoration costs, forensic investigation fees, ransomware extortion negotiations, and regulatory fines following a network breach or system compromise. It routinely leaves out unencrypted portable devices taken outside the premises, social engineering wire-transfer fraud where funds are willingly transferred under false pretenses, and downtime caused by unpatched legacy operating systems. Standing in your office, we ask: if your warehouse inventory system or dispatch server were encrypted by ransomware on a Friday evening, how long could your team pick and dispatch orders manually?',
	'k340c1956' => 'A walk of the yard and building with the owner, with the current schedule and every wording in hand, so what is on paper is read against what is on the floor.',
	'k34307df0' => 'TRADES',
	'k34f6a84b' => 'Wholesale and Trade Counters',
	'k3601146c' => 'Price',
	'k361b09a7' => 'Print and packaging workshops operate with volatile solvents, high paper loads, and expensive client-supplied materials stored on the shop floor. Property, public liability, and goods in trust extensions matter most to protect against catastrophic shop-floor fires. Typical schedules fail by treating customer paper and printing plates as standard stock rather than legally held goods in trust. For example, a carton packaging workshop held €85,000 worth of customer-supplied board during a press breakdown, only to find their basic commercial schedule excluded customer property that was not explicitly scheduled.',
