	'k3b4be8bb' => 'Inès Laurent is a commercial broker focusing on public, products, and employers\' liability along with commercial contract wording. Inès reads complex vendor agreements and subcontractor indemnities to ensure policy wordings do not leave firms exposed to uninsured legal liabilities. Sofia Varga serves as our client service lead, managing renewals, policy schedules, certificate issuance, and day-to-day client documentation. Sofia ensures every policy amendment is processed accurately and renewals are prepared months in advance.',
