	'k3e7ea65c' => 'We respect your inbox and handle your contact information with strict confidentiality. Renewal Notes is sent exactly four times per year, with no intermediate sales pitches or sponsor messages. You can unsubscribe at any time with a single click using the link at the bottom of every email, or by contacting our office directly at review@hojobrokers.example. Your email address is stored securely and is never shared with external insurers, marketing agencies, or third-party service providers.',
	'k3ed639d0' => 'Hojo Brokers',
	'k3ef7d70f' => 'CLAIMS',
	'k447f7eff' => 'Once you request a review, Sofia Varga contacts you within two working days to schedule our 90-minute on-site visit. A senior broker and risk surveyor walk your yard and buildings, reviewing physical operations alongside your current schedule. Within 10 working days of the walk, we deliver a written cover map detailing what is insured, what is excluded, and where underinsurance exists. We then meet for 60 minutes to explain our findings and discuss placement options from 3–5 insurers. You incur no fees and remain under no obligation to place cover.',
	'k44c3c180' => 'FEES',
	'k4626668b' => '3rd floor, 18 Quayside Road, Calder Bay',
	'k47559fb8' => 'NEXT',
	'k497c221c' => 'Property and stock cover pays for physical destruction or damage to your buildings, machinery, tenant improvements, and declared stock caused by insured perils such as fire, storm, or escape of water. It routinely leaves out stock stored above sprinkler heads, materials kept in open yards without prior insurer agreement, and inventory valued at flat annual averages during peak seasonal surges. During our on-site inspection, we walk your warehouse floor and ask: what is the single highest valuation of stock held within this building across the past twelve months, and does your declared sum reflect that peak or merely a quiet baseline?',
	'k49c43385' => 'Mara Hojo',
	'k49f45acd' => '<a class="hb-cell" href="/covers/#cover-1"><span class="hb-cell__t">Property and stock</span><span class="hb-cell__d">Buildings, plant and stock, and whether the declared value matches what is on the racks.</span></a>
