	'k78d9d786' => 'PRIVACY',
	'k790c37ba' => 'The review begins on your premises with a 90-minute walk of your yard, warehouse, and workshop buildings alongside the business owner or operations director. We inspect physical fire separations, racking clearances, yard security, loading docks, and storage methods. At the same time, we collect your current insurance schedule, policy wordings, and endorsement slips. We do not sell insurance during this visit; our goal is simply to observe how your premises function and compare that operational reality against the declarations and warranties printed in your current documents.',
	'k7a52d1fc' => 'Inès Laurent',
	'k7bf91c8f' => '1 visit',
